STO#E_FT2 __E_FT2__placeholder__       !E_FT2 - Youngs Modulus PE 2.x
STO#E_a10 __E_a10__placeholder__       !E_a10 - Youngs Modulus abutment wall
STO#E_a20 __E_a20__placeholder__       !E_a20 - Youngs Modulus piers axis 2
